# Presentation Preparation: Defending "How & Why"

When presenting to a project guide, the focus shifts from *what* the code does to *why* you made those architectural decisions over alternatives, and *how* they solve the core problem. 

This guide anticipates the toughest questions a panel/guide will ask and provides your defense.

---

