        H -->|Normal Data Only| L[GMM Anomaly Detector]
        K --> M{CNN Prediction Output}
        L -->|Is it anomalous?| N{Gatekeeper}
        M -->|Wait for 5 Windows| N
        N -->|Consensus Reached| O((Trigger Final Alert))
    end
```

